{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"createTracker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"namespace","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endpoint","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"method","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HttpMethodOptions","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/HttpMethodOptions","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPHttpMethod"},{"text":" = .post) -> (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackerController","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/TrackerController","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(pl)SPTrackerController"},{"text":")?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The namespace used to identify the current tracker among the possible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"multiple tracker instances."}]}],"name":"namespace"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The URL of the collector.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"endpoint"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method for the requests to the collector (GET or POST)."}]}],"name":"method"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker instance created.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The app can run multiple tracker instances which will be identified by string "},{"code":"namespaces","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tracker will be configured with default setting and only the collector endpoint URL need"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be passed for the configuration."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For the default configuration of the tracker see "},{"code":"TrackerConfiguration(String)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To configure tracker with more details see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createTracker(Context, String, NetworkConfiguration, Configuration...)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To use the tracker as singleton see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getDefaultTracker()"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: The EventStore will persist all the events that have been tracked but not yet sent."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Those events are attached to the namespace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method "},{"code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"code":"SPSQLEventStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in